<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{eventName}} - Media Center</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --deep-bg: #f0f2f5;
            --navy-main: #1e293b;
            --gold-accent: #c5a059;
            --card-white: #ffffff;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--deep-bg);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .base-card {
            background: var(--navy-main);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-top: 60px; /* Space for the floating media */
        }

        /* Floating Media Container */
        .floating-media {
            width: 90%;
            margin: -60px auto 0;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 4px solid var(--card-white);
            line-height: 0;
        }

        .floating-media img, .floating-media video {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            max-height: 450px;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .card-content h1 {
            color: var(--gold-accent);
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .guest-tag {
            background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-accent);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: var(--gold-accent);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .welcome-msg {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .btn-stack {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--gold-accent);
            color: var(--navy-main);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #d4af37;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border-color: white;
        }

        .footer-text {
            padding: 25px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .btn-stack { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="base-card">
        <div class="floating-media">
            {{#if isVideo}}
                <video controls preload="auto" poster="{{thumbnailUrl}}">
                    <source src="{{mediaUrl}}" type="video/mp4">
                </video>
            {{else}}
                <img src="{{mediaUrl}}" alt="Kỷ niệm {{guestName}}">
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="card-content">
            <h1>{{eventName}}</h1>
            <div class="guest-tag">Khách mời: {{guestName}}</div>
            
            <p class="welcome-msg">
                Cảm ơn Quý khách đã dành thời gian quý báu tham dự sự kiện. 
                Dưới đây là hình ảnh kỷ niệm được hệ thống tự động ghi lại.
            </p>

            <div class="btn-stack">
                <a href="{{mediaUrl}}" download class="btn btn-primary">Lưu hình ảnh</a>
                {{#if driveViewUrl}}
                <a href="{{driveViewUrl}}" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">Xem trên Drive</a>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-text">
            © {{year}} {{eventName}} - Cung cấp bởi Ban Tổ Chức
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
